{
 "_doc": "Expert closing, deck shot (ExpertClosingSequence 0x41c650 .. ExpertClosingCrewStep 0x41ceb7). Six sailors, one script each, cut from ExpertCraneTable (0x4415a4) at its -3 bytes. A script is a list of 4-byte records [op, item, mirror, delay]; item i is picture 2012 + i (bundle 0x1d1 item 10-26 = pictures 2022-2038, 28 x 26), mirror 1 = drawn mirrored. ExpertClosingCrewStep runs once per 18-tick step; per actor: while delay < 1 the script advances one record (the first step starts at record 0); the op then acts: -8 wait (nothing drawn), -2 draw, -4 x += 4 then draw, -5 x -= 4 then draw, -7 y += 10 then draw, -6 y -= 10 then draw; a draw / move op loads the record's delay the first time it is reached; delay is counted down once per step, so a record lasts `delay` steps (a move op moves once per step); -3 (the closing record, [-3, 0, 0, 0] here) draws the previous record's picture once more at the current position and restarts the script at its first record (the position is NOT reset). Each step ExpertClosingEraseCrew first restores the 28 x 26 rectangle under every actor, so an actor that draws nothing in a step is invisible in it.",
